      "originalText": "持久队列高可用执行器 (dispatch_mode=queue)\n(lease.py: LeaseWorker + run_leases / worker_nodes)\n• 1/3 TTL 心跳续租 + fenced_by_heartbeat 自熔断\n• Monotonic Epoch Fencing 拦截僵尸写 (StaleEpochError)\n• 超限接管 takeover_count >= max_takeovers(3) -> DLQ",
